    "US customary quantities. Source ranges resolved as: 1 fresh chili (1\u20132), 7 dried chilies (6\u20138), 1 tbsp ground Sichuan peppercorn with 1/4 tsp reserved for garnish (1/2\u20131 1/2 tbsp), 1.5 tbsp doubanjiang (1\u20132).",
    "Chicken broth is 2/3 cup, stored as 0.667 cup; the source allows water as a substitute.",
    "Optional sesame oil, sugar, and peppercorn garnish are included.",
    "Ginger and garlic quantities are minced volumes. Measurement is modeled before mincing, so these portions approximate the prepared amount.",
    "Chilies toast in a small saucepan so the wok stays free; the source allows a wok or small saucepan. Skipping the toast with homemade chili oil is not modeled.",
    "Equipment names describe requirements, not the actual kitchen inventory. Cleaning, serving, and rice are outside this recipe.",
    "Measurement durations are explicit planning estimates."
  ],
  "outputs": [
    "garnished_mapo_tofu"
  ],
